+        """Recomputes the pixel-space polygon for this frame's actual
+        resolution. Cheap (a handful of points) — safe to call every frame,
+        which also means a mid-stream resolution change (e.g. an RTSP
+        renegotiation) self-corrects on the very next frame."""
+        if (width, height) == self._frame_size:
